raspberries raspberry berries berry rows bushes plants crop around~
   Rows of raspberry bushes stretch across the ground, their thin canes dotted
with clusters of ripe red berries. The fruit glows softly against a backdrop of
bright green leaves, while small, fine thorns trace the stems. The bushes feel
lively and abundant, carefully balanced between cultivation and the wild.
